+/****************************************************************************
+ * Name: esp_wifi_lock
+ *
+ * Description:
+ *   Lock or unlock the event process
+ *
+ * Input Parameters:
+ *   lock - true: Lock event process, false: unlock event process
+ *
+ * Returned Value:
+ *   The result of lock or unlock the event process
+ *
